OL,3,AGoogle hit with bB,403m fine by Irish
OL,4,Adata watchdog over GDPR violations
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle has been fined bB,403m (#345m)
OL,7,Fby the Republic of Ireland's Data
OL,8,FProtection Commission (DPC) over its
OL,9,Fhandling of location data.
OL,11,FThe penalty - one of the largest of its
OL,12,Fkind imposed by the Irish watchdog
OL,13,Fauthority - followed an inquiry
OL,14,Flaunched into the tech giant six years
OL,15,Fago, following complaints from several
OL,16,FEuropean consumer rights organisations.
OL,18,FOn Monday the DPC said its
OL,19,Finvestigation found Google had
OL,20,Fprocessed data in a manner that was not
OL,21,F"lawful", "fair" or "transparent".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
