OL,3,AGoogle hit with bB,403m fine by Irish
OL,4,Adata watchdog over GDPR violations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry concerned Google's
OL,7,Fprocessing of location data in three
OL,8,Fspecific features - Web & App Activity,
OL,9,FLocation History and Location Accuracy
OL,10,Fbetween 25 May 2018 to 4 February 2020.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
